  "prompt": "Check Mailvora's purchases day by day for the Dublin days 1 to 7 December 2025. On the export side, count the purchase events by event_date (the day in Dublin). On the backend side, count the subscriptions whose first payment (their earliest paid_at in payments) falls on that Dublin day; a first payment that was later refunded counts, as the export keeps its purchase. Return four columns, in this order: day (the Dublin day as text, in the same form as event_date), export_purchases, backend_first_payments and difference (export_purchases minus backend_first_payments). Return one row for each day with purchases. Any row order is fine.",
